.PS
# Double-tuned (coupled-resonator) band-pass: two 10u || 10n tanks
# (f0 = 503 kHz, Q = 31.6 with the 1k source and load) coupled by
# k = 0.1. kQ > 1, so the pair is overcoupled: two peaks near
# f0/sqrt(1 +- k) = 480 and 531 kHz, each at the matched-transfer
# limit |v(vout)| = 1/2.
spice = 1
In:   (0.3,2)
Pri:  (1.4,2)
Vout: (4.8,2)

V1: acsource((0.3,2), (0.3,0), AC 1)
RS: resistor((0.3,2), (1.4,2), 1k)
C1: capacitor((1.4,2), (1.4,0), 10n)
L1: inductor((2.2,2), (2.2,0), 10u)
L2: inductor((3.2,2), (3.2,0), 10u)
K1: coupling(L1, L2, 0.1)
C2: capacitor((4,2), (4,0), 10n)
RL: resistor((4.8,2), (4.8,0), 1k)

line from C1.P to L1.P
line from L2.P to RL.P
line from V1.N to RL.N
dot at C1.P; dot at C2.P
dot at C1.N; dot at L1.N; dot at L2.N; dot at C2.N
ground(V1.N)
.ac lin 401 400k 650k
.PE
